Windows Visual Atlas: explicitly authorized one-shot Windows capture request

This sentinel is introduced with the initial atlas implementation. The new
Windows Visual Atlas workflow listens for its addition on main and runs the
initial source-bound, build-once, process/job-sharded screenshot campaign.
It is NOT a periodic trigger. Do not edit this file in routine future work.
After the first attempt, use workflow_dispatch for manual recaptures.

Scope: real Windows SDL readback using the existing ROM-verified native driver.
No physical hardware, controller/audio or release acceptance implied.
